  "content": {
    "title": "When is spring break is for students in Broome, Tioga, Chenango counties?",
    "text": "March 16, 2026, 5:02 a.m. ETNow that bitter cold temperatures are behind us, spring can't come fast enough.For students, that means a week off school and hopefully some fun in the sun. For many of us, the grass starting to turn green and the sun shining mean winter is over, but the official spring equinox doesn't fall until March 20 in the United States.St. Patrick's Day decorations will be coming down and traded in for Easter baskets and pastel-colored marshmallow Peeps. Most school districts give students Good Friday on April 3 off leading into their week-long vacation.Here's when students go on spring break at schools in Broome, Tioga, Chenango and Delaware counties.Broome CountyBinghamton City School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Vestal School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Union-Endicott School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Broome-Tioga BOCES AcademySpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Catholic Schools of Broome CountySpring break for students will be April 2 to April 10.Chenango Forks CentralSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Chenango Valley CentralSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Deposit Central SchoolSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Harpursville SchoolSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Johnson City SchoolSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Maine-EndwellSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Susquehanna ValleySpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Whitney PointSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Windsor CentralSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Tioga CountyCandor Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be March 30 to April 3.Newark Valley CentralSpring break for students will be April 6 to April 10.Owego Apalachin Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Spencer-Van Etten Central School DistrictSpring break for students will April 3 to April 10.Tioga Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Waverly School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Chenango CountyAfton Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Bainbridge-Guilford Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Greene School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Norwich City School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Unadilla Valley Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Otselic Valley Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Oxford Academy & Central SchoolsSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Sherburne-Earlville Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Delaware CountyAndes Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Charlotte Valley Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Delaware Central School District at DelhiSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Downsville Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Franklin Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Hancock Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Margaretville Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Roxbury Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Sidney Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.South Kortright Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Stamford Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Walton Central School DistrictSpring break for students will be April 3 to April 10.Kalyn Grant reports on public service issues for the Press & Sun-Bulletin, focusing on schools and community impact. Have a story to share? Follow her on Instagram @KalynCarmen and on Facebook under Kalyn Kearney. Get in touch at KCGrant@usatodayco.com",
